OL,3,GNEWSACalls to cut employer National
OL,4,AInsurance contributions for under-25s
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses across Yorkshire are urging
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey to cut National
OL,8,FInsurance (NI) contributions for
OL,9,Funder-25s in his first Budget.
OL,11,FWest & North Yorkshire Chamber of
OL,12,FCommerce, which represents 5,000
OL,13,Femployers in the region, said the
OL,14,Freduction would help tackle the "youth
OL,15,Funemployment crisis".
OL,17,FHealey will deliver his first Budget on
OL,18,F28 October, but has refused to rule out
OL,19,Ftax increases after acknowledging that
OL,20,Fgovernment borrowing costs were at
OL,21,F"historic highs".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
