OL,3,GNEWSACalls to cut employer National
OL,4,AInsurance contributions for under-25s
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome businesses have told the BBC they
OL,7,Fwere still struggling after the "shock"
OL,8,Fincreases in employers' NI
OL,9,Fcontributions in 2024 and were hoping
OL,10,Ffor tax reliefs.
